  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{pH}=3 \\ldots\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=10^{-3} ; \\quad \\mathrm{pH}=6$\n$\\therefore\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]=10^{-6}$. Hence $\\left[\\mathrm{H}^{+}\\right]$ is reduced by\n$10^{-3}$ times.",
